{"4113160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Begraved", "steam_appid": 4113160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steal from the Dead. Pay the Living</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Begraved</strong> is a first-person co-op dungeon crawler set in the decaying land of Goria where death collects its dues, and survival is a borrowed grace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of the <strong>Gravebound</strong>, condemned to loot cursed tombs around the city, driven by a corrupt balance of ruin and despair. Beneath the ground you delve, where forgotten snares await the unwary, whispers coil in the dark, and curses rest silent within relics long undisturbed. Your light is limited, your pack is small, and the Taxman will come whether you live or die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge what you can, make it out alive, and pay your dues. Or face the rope, unpaid and unburied.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113160/extras/e91aa48b95bf5f72374f5d652e9c89d8.poster.avif?t=1785148905\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113160/extras/e91aa48b95bf5f72374f5d652e9c89d8.webm?t=1785148905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Loot Fast. Escape Alive</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person dungeon crawling for 1 to 5 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated tombs filled with hazards, secrets, and things best left undisturbed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your tools such as torches, mallets, or gear with unusual traits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited inventory space forces tough choices between loot and survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo play or co-op. Together or alone, the crypts’ horrors do not relent</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat intensifies cooperation, fear, and betrayal</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition is a risk. Every step deeper is a gamble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113160/extras/cac5127c1e12cc76066ba820edd350d5.poster.avif?t=1785148905\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113160/extras/cac5127c1e12cc76066ba820edd350d5.webm?t=1785148905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Death Collects Its Cut</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land of Goria does not care how you get rich only that you pay what you owe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return from a run and sell your findings to the <strong>Shopkeeper</strong>, a masked merchant who provides tools, gear, and quiet support. But every few days, the <strong>Taxman</strong> arrives, and he does not negotiate... or maybe he does? Fail to pay and your sentence ends at the gallows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113160/extras/b01b0739b4cf84d18c41d19fa16f4120.poster.avif?t=1785148905\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113160/extras/b01b0739b4cf84d18c41d19fa16f4120.webm?t=1785148905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decorate Your Hideout</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hideout starts small and empty, a quiet space beneath the city waiting to be shaped. Bring back rugs, banners, beds, chairs, and other treasures from the tombs to decorate and make it your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find pets to keep you company as you rest and prepare for your next run. Each item adds a touch of comfort and life to this fragile sanctuary in the darkness.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steal from the Dead. Pay the Living</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Begraved</strong> is a first-person co-op dungeon crawler set in the decaying land of Goria where death collects its dues, and survival is a borrowed grace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of the <strong>Gravebound</strong>, condemned to loot cursed tombs around the city, driven by a corrupt balance of ruin and despair. Beneath the ground you delve, where forgotten snares await the unwary, whispers coil in the dark, and curses rest silent within relics long undisturbed. Your light is limited, your pack is small, and the Taxman will come whether you live or die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge what you can, make it out alive, and pay your dues. Or face the rope, unpaid and unburied.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113160/extras/e91aa48b95bf5f72374f5d652e9c89d8.poster.avif?t=1785148905\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113160/extras/e91aa48b95bf5f72374f5d652e9c89d8.webm?t=1785148905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Loot Fast. Escape Alive</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person dungeon crawling for 1 to 5 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated tombs filled with hazards, secrets, and things best left undisturbed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your tools such as torches, mallets, or gear with unusual traits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited inventory space forces tough choices between loot and survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo play or co-op. Together or alone, the crypts’ horrors do not relent</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat intensifies cooperation, fear, and betrayal</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition is a risk. Every step deeper is a gamble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113160/extras/cac5127c1e12cc76066ba820edd350d5.poster.avif?t=1785148905\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113160/extras/cac5127c1e12cc76066ba820edd350d5.webm?t=1785148905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Death Collects Its Cut</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land of Goria does not care how you get rich only that you pay what you owe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return from a run and sell your findings to the <strong>Shopkeeper</strong>, a masked merchant who provides tools, gear, and quiet support. But every few days, the <strong>Taxman</strong> arrives, and he does not negotiate... or maybe he does? Fail to pay and your sentence ends at the gallows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113160/extras/b01b0739b4cf84d18c41d19fa16f4120.poster.avif?t=1785148905\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113160/extras/b01b0739b4cf84d18c41d19fa16f4120.webm?t=1785148905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decorate Your Hideout</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hideout starts small and empty, a quiet space beneath the city waiting to be shaped. Bring back rugs, banners, beds, chairs, and other treasures from the tombs to decorate and make it your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find pets to keep you company as you rest and prepare for your next run. Each item adds a touch of comfort and life to this fragile sanctuary in the darkness.</p>", "short_description": "A cosy &amp; dark first-person co-op dungeon crawler where you loot cursed crypts, dodge traps, and flee from things that should not move. Escape with treasures snatched from the dead. Decorate your hideout, uncover buried secrets, and remember: the Taxman always comes for his due.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113160/4d4df7bdf22a4798bdcce9302de432ea2b29e494/header.jpg?t=1785148905", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113160/5db6f6d80e2502462f4777cfdc72914938556d2b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785148905", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113160/5db6f6d80e2502462f4777cfdc72914938556d2b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785148905", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 Ti / AMD RX 560 (4 GB VRAM minimum)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> 